keywords:
  - llm
  - model-routing
  - cost-optimization
  - hermes-agent
  - value-leaderboard
abstract: "A Hermes Agent llm_request/llm_execution middleware pair that classifies each turn once (routine vs strategic) and routes it down a 4-tier ladder - downgrade to the provider's free rung, serve near-routine turns on a cheap flash workhorse, keep hard turns on the mid rung, or escalate to premium (credit-probed, fail-closed) - with re-applied decisions across every call of a turn, a fail-open contract, shadow-by-default rollout, and per-provider rungs derived from a live value leaderboard feed rather than hardcoded model ids."
